1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,004
Our last new word was petroleum: oil found underground and used to make fuels and other products.

2
00:00:05,954 --> 00:00:09,875
A leak could release a toxic pollutant and contaminate water.

3
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:13,500
It could endanger animals and jeopardise people’s lives.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,125
Do not let a small problem deteriorate,’ Mira wrote.

5
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:20,659
Careless actions can aggravate it and degrade the land.

6
00:00:20,659 --> 00:00:24,374
If we deforest a hillside, rain may erode its soil.

7
00:00:24,374 --> 00:00:26,977
These were no longer separate words.

8
00:00:26,977 --> 00:00:30,204
They described choices that people make every day.

